            <div xml:id="d211">

                <pb facs="0206" n="196" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg196"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/10–2549: Airgram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Korea</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Muccio</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-22">November 22,
                        1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>A–230. Re your A–336 October 25 Department assumes President Rhee not being
                    permitted to lose sight of serious and adverse effect <pb facs="0207" n="197"
                        xml:id="pg197"/> on international position of Republic of Korea which would
                    result from decision of Korean Government to sever relations with British
                    Government over issue of Chinese Communist recognition.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
